Hello everyone,

A new version of the PeopleHub app comes out on Tuesday 28 July. PeopleHub is the app where you update your address, your emergency contact and your bank details.

What changes:
- A new home screen with your next planned days off and your team calendar.
- You can now add a photo to your profile.
- Sign-in uses the same password as your work email.

Your phone should update the app by itself. If it does not, open the app store and tap "Update". On the office computers nothing changes, because PeopleHub opens in the browser.

Please check that your emergency contact is still correct after the update. If you cannot sign in, call the IT helpdesk on extension 200 or write to it@contoso-water.example.

Kind regards,
Priya
